# - Auto-generated messages (no stored message field)
# - Offline-only monitoring (empty threshold/condition)
# - Per-device offline delays with global fallback
# - Threshold breach triggers correct alert
# - Device offline/online detection works
# - Dashboard form creates alerts correctly

# BLUEPRINT
# - Blueprint appears in automation creation UI
# - All fields work (entity, state, message, level, channel, location, duration)
# - Created automations trigger correctly

